# Check out text files with LF on every platform. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true (so do GitHub's Windows runners), which would hand Windows
# clones CRLF files; gofmt -l then reports every .go file as unformatted, and the
# windows-latest CI job would test different bytes than Linux and macOS. Binary
# files (the screenshots) are detected by text=auto and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
